              <h3>Agile Terminology</h3>
<p>Let's take a closer look at some of the most common terms that you hear about and use when working in an Agile environment.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
          data-base="cp3_u1_s2_p1_epics_features_stories_backlogs" 
          data-ext=".mp4" 
          data-multi="false"
